WEBVTT

00:02:29.811 --> 00:02:33.096
ta’minlash maqsadida foydalaniladi.

00:02:33.096 --> 00:02:37.503
Ammo platsebolar ham o’z ta’sir 
kuchini ko’rsatishini bilamiz.

00:02:37.503 --> 00:02:38.952
Platsebo effekti boriga shukur

00:02:38.952 --> 00:02:41.954
bemorlarning bari sohta dori ichgan yoki 
yolg'on jarrohlikni

00:02:41.954 --> 00:02:43.273
boshdan kechirgan bo'lishsa

00:02:43.273 --> 00:02:44.422
ham, ular yurak

00:02:44.422 --> 00:02:46.130
xastaliklari, astma va

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:50.126
qattiq og’riq kabi bir qancha 
dardlardan forig’ bo’lishdi.

00:02:50.126 --> 00:02:52.766
Uning mexanizmini tushunishga 
hanuz urinmoqdamiz

00:02:52.766 --> 00:02:54.765
Platsebo effektiga shubha qiluvchilar
uning

00:02:54.765 --> 00:02:58.625
boshqa omillar bilan adashtirib 
yuborilishiga ishonishadi, misol uchun

00:02:58.625 --> 00:03:03.129
bemor shifokorga ahvoli o’nglanganini 
aytib ko’nglini ko’tarishga intilishi.